  "page_title": "Method Man",
  "summary": "Clifford Smith Jr., known professionally as Method Man, is an American rapper, record producer, and actor. He is a member of the East Coast hip-hop collective Wu-Tang Clan, and is half of the hip-hop duo Method Man \u0026 Redman. His debut solo album, Tical (1994), peaked at number four on the Billboard 200 and spawned the single \"I'll Be There for You/You're All I Need to Get By\", which won Best Rap Performance by a Duo or Group at the 38th Annual Grammy Awards. The song also peaked within the top five of the Billboard Hot 100; he and Blige later starred in Power Book II: Ghost, a spin-off of Power.",
